<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">旧密码</text>
      <input class="field-input" password placeholder="请输入当前密码"
             placeholder-class="field-input-placeholder"
             value="{{oldPassword}}" data-field="oldPassword" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">新密码</text>
      <input class="field-input" password placeholder="6-20 位"
             placeholder-class="field-input-placeholder"
             value="{{newPassword}}" data-field="newPassword" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">确认密码</text>
      <input class="field-input" password placeholder="再次输入新密码"
             placeholder-class="field-input-placeholder"
             value="{{confirm}}" data-field="confirm" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    · 需要先校验旧密码，确认是本人操作
    · 修改成功后当前登录状态会失效，需用新密码重新登录
  </view>

  <view class="actions">
    <button class="btn-primary" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">
      {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '确认修改'}}
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
